(qqg)
the time limits for various stages in processing applications for grant of mineral concession under section 10B, 10BA, 11,
11A, 11B, 11D, and section 17A, and their renewals;
(qqi)
the terms and conditions for grant of prospecting license-cum-mining leases under sub-section (4) of section 11;
(qqj)
